  "releaseNotes": "v1.0.1-preview.14\n- Added web integration packages (FireForNet.Firebase.Messaging.Browser and FireForNet.Firebase.Messaging.Blazor) that implement the platform contracts for FID-based registration, message delivery, and permission management on the web.\n\nv1.0.1-preview.13\n- Initial release of the Firebase Messaging core package.\n- FID-based FCM registration (RegisterAsync/UnregisterAsync/OnRegistered/OnUnregistered).\n- Message delivery events (OnMessageReceived/OnNotificationOpened) and one-shot GetInitialMessageAsync.\n- Notification permission management (GetPermissionStatusAsync/RequestPermissionAsync).\n- Topic subscription (SubscribeToTopicAsync/UnsubscribeFromTopicAsync).\n- Contract-driven platform contracts (IMessagingRegistrar, IMessagingEventSource, IMessagingPermissionManager, IMessagingTopicSubscriber).",
